N5008 [dcl.init.ref]/5, [conv.ptr]/3: binding `A &' to a D is a
derived-to-base conversion, ill-formed when A is an ambiguous base of D
([class.mi]/4: D has two A subobjects).  g++ 13 ("'A' is an ambiguous base
of 'D'") and clang++ 18 ("ambiguous conversion from derived class 'D' to
base class 'A'") reject this program.
